  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">《Beh按怎泡一杯好lim ê茶（三）》</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">/</span><span style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">戴瑞民</span></span></h1><div><span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: xx-large; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhFlmwPL0K9n19aN9h_bHH4zuupohtpl7sIgfGDpBSeN_xnaU4KXgN11uMkIklo1OD1VqOQEUcC8MI3G8m2TUuowavxhVS4aL7SH3ccv928qYvdtahRDE5MsNb4nWMY5A6WjWQYy07ttTmMXzVRlTR73T2SonIlzPrnMngP4pa8F9XOU-iBBIruWRjOxkWD\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhFlmwPL0K9n19aN9h_bHH4zuupohtpl7sIgfGDpBSeN_xnaU4KXgN11uMkIklo1OD1VqOQEUcC8MI3G8m2TUuowavxhVS4aL7SH3ccv928qYvdtahRDE5MsNb4nWMY5A6WjWQYy07ttTmMXzVRlTR73T2SonIlzPrnMngP4pa8F9XOU-iBBIruWRjOxkWD\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEsLw6ZCFg8bChQjPuJjX5qRNWZkfg_wvT_ZKiZnRLqn7w62pLYaRZb3IDvs91DwMN4LMK0zM5_MFc807zLnGuek1OQNUkY6fv1GMaLi1kvjXk0ehAEmThXwM67TZJHDtQABVjuiOoh00XIIwd6TGcw_by1mf1jktLUgHoIAjRDQgYmGcwpNgs8JC1bpey\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEsLw6ZCFg8bChQjPuJjX5qRNWZkfg_wvT_ZKiZnRLqn7w62pLYaRZb3IDvs91DwMN4LMK0zM5_MFc807zLnGuek1OQNUkY6fv1GMaLi1kvjXk0ehAEmThXwM67TZJHDtQABVjuiOoh00XIIwd6TGcw_by1mf1jktLUgHoIAjRDQgYmGcwpNgs8JC1bpey\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi2dE5zb7-w1PTQrNUXICsJgbuf8pmiiS2IzOrb3UbeUfMWdbH9e1Udh8xgYWzCh2xiGmrFhxpp_37YVyo7htOrAXcpoRcmGWEjWdBd_oXql7N61FTzXVCVjJMRQcJ4zMUa1vwYFM88YIR4VOB1Qat2jXZy4q0IdLwsTYvRiEchQU-Zk8DiQGyQv111aouV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi2dE5zb7-w1PTQrNUXICsJgbuf8pmiiS2IzOrb3UbeUfMWdbH9e1Udh8xgYWzCh2xiGmrFhxpp_37YVyo7htOrAXcpoRcmGWEjWdBd_oXql7N61FTzXVCVjJMRQcJ4zMUa1vwYFM88YIR4VOB1Qat2jXZy4q0IdLwsTYvRiEchQU-Zk8DiQGyQv111aouV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhRFsjBIFDRmurzX-t6LZeL171btfQpXeWzdXDFUzo3GIcHl9JNYsAM6wm2mYmgb31YvaiAWdpUitsQG6Z6A5SreiSHK5MILTfSk99aUb8axCVf7zbdt3rGQ5rjZ0hy0GLk1HyemD7-Pn6kiu4noL9RAX-QoCi2NXYE_PyQ_C6Q5n6n2nkR50xaHMOriflL\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"1518\" data-original-width=\"1075\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhRFsjBIFDRmurzX-t6LZeL171btfQpXeWzdXDFUzo3GIcHl9JNYsAM6wm2mYmgb31YvaiAWdpUitsQG6Z6A5SreiSHK5MILTfSk99aUb8axCVf7zbdt3rGQ5rjZ0hy0GLk1HyemD7-Pn6kiu4noL9RAX-QoCi2NXYE_PyQ_C6Q5n6n2nkR50xaHMOriflL=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: xx-large; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">頂一擺講到「茶米量、水溫、浸泡時間」tsit三个因素，是決定一杯茶好lim，iah是無好lim上基本ê原因，m̄-koh，有tiānn-tiānn泡茶ê人lóng知影，平平仝款ê條件，是按怎有人斟--出-來ê茶，逐家lóng呵咾好lim koh bē礙胃，有人斟--出-來--ê就是一杯眾人嫌ê茶--leh？</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Lán學一項技術ê過程，除了正常學習ê課程以外，當然mā ài tiānn-tiānn練習，學茶mā仝款，古早人講一句話：「Tsia̍p泡，就好lim，tsia̍p lim就ē-hiáu講」。啥mih時tsūn tsiah有法度泡出一杯「芳氣十足koh有層次，茶湯軟水koh gâu回甘，喉韻飽tīnn koh久長」ê茶--leh？Tsia̍p泡、tsia̍p lim是一定ài做ê工夫，無tiānn-tiānn泡，工夫當然mā學bē起--來；m̄-koh kan-na因為愛lim茶，只是時常泡、sù常lim，mā無一定就ē-hiáu泡出一杯好lim ê茶--ōo。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">是啥mih緣故--leh？假使講kan-na tsia̍p泡、tsia̍p lim，時間一下久，自然就ē-tàng kā好茶泡--出-來，若是án-ne，有lim茶ê人，是m̄是年紀愈大就愈gâu泡茶，kám是án-ne --leh？事實上，觀察lán身邊ê人，kánn-ná m̄是án-ne--őo！Tse親像細漢ê時tsūn，tuè爸母去廟--裡拜拜，lán kan-na ē-hiáu gōng-gōng「攑香tuè拜」，拜一世人mā m̄知teh拜啥。泡茶mā是仝款：「茶米lióng</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: x-small;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">--過，囥好了後，確定滾水ê溫度，燒水罐khe̍h--起-來，水kā倒--入-去，開始算時間，時間若到，tsiah kā茶湯倒--出-來，án-ne一杯茶就泡好--ah！」是--lah，tse是照課程ê標準動作：「一杯茶泡好」，m̄-koh，m̄是：「泡一杯好茶」。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Beh學泡茶外型ê動作tsiânn簡單，tī茶藝班認真泡一學期ê茶就ē-hiáu；m̄-koh每一个動作內底，koh有tsiok濟lán看bē著ê撇步，tsit點可能就ài tsiok認真lim三年六個月ê茶——小等--一-下，m̄-thang聽著三年六個月，就認為beh來畢業、出師--ah，到tsia只是學ē-hiáu kā茶泡hōo好lim niā-niā，若是你ê標準是到tsia為止就好，當然ē-sái算是出師--ah。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">不而過，lán beh學ê茶kám kan-na án-ne niâ？Kā茶泡hōo好lim了後--leh？你kám有想--過，你bat用心泡過茶--無？Bat用心lim過茶--無？茶ê滋味是啥mi̍h？啥mi̍h又koh是茶--leh？後遍若有機會，lán繼續koh來開講，泡好茶有啥mih撇步。</span></div></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: small;\">（Suà--來無定期連載）</span></div><div><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">1 秤茶米重量ê意思。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEheiPHFkAqGShp9loyQMHLNVr2XP3eL2YQrCvRqi2OhNHXdITg1lxY85CLb_i7X7KqFMdAAtvs_y18hNW6KhS8u2K-07F6HFpJ5R-G3S_JDT57qpf3tszsERaP1wzHewE3ccUJwLuN6ugYeGLt8bKAtxl6BeernGPRv5vdRD0cTG8JmI-k7jApdtgCDytGX\" style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: large; margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em; text-align: center;\"><img data-original-height=\"729\" data-original-width=\"512\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/im